  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">神射手</span> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">竞技场</span></strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">本地图专为枪械MOD的射击练习而制作。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">设施</span></strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・商店</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・室内靶场 = 5~100米</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・室外靶场</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・室内CQB靶场</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・室外CQB靶场</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・后坐力测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・穿透测试</span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">所需MOD</span></strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span>[TaCZ] Timeless and Classics Zero &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span>Vic's Point Blank <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vics-point-blank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vics-point-blank</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">（除TaCZ和Vic's外，其他MOD也可使用）</span><span style=\"color:#fff\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span>MmmMmmMmmMmm (靶人偶)</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm</a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">+</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">ver 2.0 ~</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">CustomNPCs-Unofficial</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customnpcs-unofficial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customnpcs-unofficial</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Advanced Shulkerboxes</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-shulkerboxes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-shulkerboxes</a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">+</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">ver 4.0~</h1>\n<p>・SDM Shop</p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-shop</a></p>\n<p>・SDM &nbsp;Economy</p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-economy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-economy</a></p>\n<p>・SDM Engine Core</p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-engine-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-engine-core</a></p>\n<p>・SDM UI Lib </p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-ui-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-ui-lib</a></p>\n<p>・FTB Library </p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge</a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>如果单独下载了世界文件，请将SDMShop文件夹放入config目录中。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">设施</span></strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・商店</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・室内靶场 = 5~100米</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・室外靶场</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・室内CQB靶场</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・室外CQB靶场</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・后坐力测试</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・穿透测试</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">所需MOD</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span>[TaCZ] Timeless and Classics Zero &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span>Vic's Point Blank <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vics-point-blank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vics-point-blank</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; （除TaCZ和Vic's外，其他MOD也可使用）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span>MmmMmmMmmMmm (靶人偶)</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm</a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">+</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">ver 2.0 ~</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">CustomNPCs-Unofficial</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customnpcs-unofficial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customnpcs-unofficial</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Advanced Shulkerboxes</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-shulkerboxes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-shulkerboxes</a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">+</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">ver 4.0~</h1>\n<p>・SDM Shop</p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-shop</a></p>\n<p>・SDM &nbsp;Economy</p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-economy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-economy</a></p>\n<p>・SDM Engine Core</p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-engine-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-engine-core</a></p>\n<p>・SDM UI Lib </p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-ui-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-ui-lib</a></p>\n<p>・FTB Library </p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge</a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>如果单独下载了世界文件，请将SDMShop文件夹放入config目录中。</p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">室内靶场</span></strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_a006818e-4333-4088-9872-8adb223dc094.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"439\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">室外靶场</span></strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_d0b5f67d-fcb3-440a-8bdb-0ad8b476df97.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"439\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">室内CQB靶场</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_fbb0b94f-921e-437f-8e19-e1d4fcb2f380.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"439\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">室外CQB靶场</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_a70f98e4-ed69-4449-b7f2-3f72b20284f0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"439\"></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">后坐力测试</span></strong><img style=\"text-align:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_eb2b8daa-3cc1-4915-a25b-3b46ad729a7c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"439\"></h3>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">穿透测试</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_75443810-98ee-47ed-b67b-5198256487b4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">商店</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_333f6fc8-66da-4e36-9562-2268fdb3add4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
